<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-16">
  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-forest/10 text-forest text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">TEM Rewards</span>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-cocoa mt-4 mb-3">Loyalty Pays Off</h1>
  <p class="text-cocoa-light mb-10">Every completed purchase delivered or picked up moves you closer to free stuff. No cards to carry, no codes to remember until you've actually earned something.</p>

  <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
    <% tiers.forEach(function(tier) { %>
      <div class="card p-6 flex items-center gap-5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-caramel/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
          <span class="font-bold text-caramel-dark"><%= tier.stageNumber %></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold text-cocoa">Stage <%= tier.stageNumber %>: <%= tier.rewardLabel %></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-cocoa-light">After <%= tier.purchasesRequired %> completed purchase<%= tier.purchasesRequired === 1 ? '' : 's' %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% }); %>
  </div>

  <div class="card p-6">
    <h2 class="font-bold text-cocoa mb-3">How It Works</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-cocoa-light list-disc list-inside">
      <li>Every order counts once it's actually completed, delivered to you, or picked up at a kiosk. A pending or in-progress order doesn't count yet.</li>
      <li>Your progress is automatic, no sign-up, no separate loyalty card. It's tied to your TEM Store account.</li>
      <li>When you reach a stage, a redemption code appears on your <a href="/profile" class="text-caramel font-semibold">profile page</a>.</li>
      <li>Show that code at any TEM Store kiosk to claim your reward - each code works once.</li>
      <li>Rewards stack - reaching Stage 4 doesn't undo what you earned at Stages 1-3.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <% if (typeof currentUser === 'undefined' || !currentUser) { %>
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <p class="text-cocoa-light mb-4">Create an account to start earning.</p>
      <a href="/register" class="btn-primary inline-flex">Get Started</a>
    </div>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <a href="/profile" class="btn-primary inline-flex">See My Progress</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>
</section>
